id=strong_guard
name=Strong Guard
version=v1.0.0
versionCode=100
author=frost-1256
description=Monitors MEETS_STRONG_INTEGRITY and auto-rotates the keybox (OhMyKeymint / TrickyStore) from live sources when it is revoked, expiring, or failing. Validates, merges EC+RSA, rolls back on failure, and can verify the verdict via the Play Integrity checker app.
